{"seq":2,"slug":"descriptors","title":"描述符与属性协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/descriptors","wordCount":861,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"描述符与属性协议\">描述符与属性协议</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>描述符（Descriptor）是 Python 属性访问机制的核心。<code>property</code>、<code>classmethod</code>、<code>staticmethod</code> 乃至 ORM 的字段定义，底层都依赖描述符协议。理解描述符，就是理解 Python 属性查找的完整链路。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>描述符是实现了 <code>__get__</code> / <code>__set__</code> / <code>__delete__</code> 中任一方法的对象，它把&quot;属性访问&quot;从简单的 <code>__dict__</code> 查表升级为可编程的钩子。理解它只需抓住两条主线：</p>\n<p><strong>第一条主线是数据描述符与非数据描述符的优先级。</strong> 完整查找链为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"数据描述符 &gt; 实例 __dict__ &gt; 非数据描述符 &gt; __getattr__\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>数据描述符 > 实例 __dict__ > 非数据描述符 > __getattr__</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这解释了 <code>property</code> 为何能覆盖实例属性（它是数据描述符），也解释了 LazyProperty 为何能把结果写回 <code>__dict__</code> 后直接命中（它是非数据描述符）。</p>\n<p><strong>第二条主线是存储位置。</strong> 描述符自身是<strong>类属性</strong>，每个实例共享同一个描述符对象，因此数据必须写入 <code>obj.__dict__</code>（<code>__slots__</code> 场景下写入 slot），绝不能存在描述符实例自身上，否则所有实例会互相污染。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据描述符</td>\n<td>同时有 <code>__get__</code> 和 <code>__set__</code></td>\n<td>高于实例属性</td>\n<td>验证 / 属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非数据描述符</td>\n<td>仅有 <code>__get__</code></td>\n<td>低于实例属性</td>\n<td>缓存 / 方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"描述符协议\">描述符协议</h2><p>描述符是定义了以下任一方法的对象：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>__get__(self, obj, objtype)</code></td>\n<td>读取属性时</td>\n<td>数据/非数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__set__(self, obj, value)</code></td>\n<td>设置属性时</td>\n<td>数据描述符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__delete__(self, obj)</code></td>\n<td>删除属性时</td>\n<td>数据描述符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__set_name__(self, owner, name)</code></td>\n<td>类创建时自动调用</td>\n<td>辅助方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据描述符-vs-非数据描述符\">数据描述符 vs 非数据描述符</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[属性查找] --&gt; B{数据描述符?}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[调用描述符 __get__]&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; D{实例 __dict__?}&#10;  D -- 有 --&gt; E[返回实例属性]&#10;  D -- 无 --&gt; F{非数据描述符?}&#10;  F -- 是 --&gt; G[调用描述符 __get__]&#10;  F -- 否 --&gt; H[AttributeError]\">graph TD\n  A[属性查找] --&gt; B{数据描述符?}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[调用描述符 __get__]\n  B -- 否 --&gt; D{实例 __dict__?}\n  D -- 有 --&gt; E[返回实例属性]\n  D -- 无 --&gt; F{非数据描述符?}\n  F -- 是 --&gt; G[调用描述符 __get__]\n  F -- 否 --&gt; H[AttributeError]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据描述符</td>\n<td>同时有 <code>__get__</code> 和 <code>__set__</code></td>\n<td>高于实例属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非数据描述符</td>\n<td>仅有 <code>__get__</code></td>\n<td>低于实例属性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本示例\">基本示例</h2><h3 id=\"类型验证描述符\">类型验证描述符</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Typed:&#10;    def __init__(self, expected_type: type):&#10;        self.expected_type = expected_type&#10;        self.name = &quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    def __set_name__(self, owner: type, name: str):&#10;        self.name = name&#10;&#10;    def __get__(self, obj, objtype=None):&#10;        if obj is None:&#10;            return self&#10;        return obj.__dict__.get(self.name)&#10;&#10;    def __set__(self, obj, value):&#10;        if not isinstance(value, self.expected_type):&#10;            raise TypeError(&#10;                f&quot;{self.name} must be {self.expected_type.__name__}, &quot;&#10;                f&quot;got {type(value).__name__}&quot;&#10;            )&#10;        obj.__dict__[self.name] = value&#10;&#10;class User:&#10;    name = Typed(str)&#10;    age = Typed(int)&#10;&#10;    def __init__(self, name: str, age: int):&#10;        self.name = name&#10;        self.age = age\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Typed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, expected_type: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __set_name__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, owner: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __get__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, obj, objtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__dict__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.get(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __set__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, obj, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected_type):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            raise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TypeError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> must be </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected_type.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"got </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        obj.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__dict__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Typed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Typed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"property-的描述符本质\">property 的描述符本质</h2><p><code>property</code> 是最常见的数据描述符：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Temperature:&#10;    def __init__(self, celsius: float = 0):&#10;        self._celsius = celsius&#10;&#10;    @property&#10;    def fahrenheit(self) -&gt; float:&#10;        return self._celsius * 9 / 5 + 32&#10;&#10;    @fahrenheit.setter&#10;    def fahrenheit(self, value: float):&#10;        self._celsius = (value - 32) * 5 / 9\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Temperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, celsius: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._celsius </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> celsius</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fahrenheit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._celsius </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @fahrenheit.setter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fahrenheit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._celsius </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>property</code> 等价于：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class property:&#10;    def __init__(self, fget=None, fset=None, fdel=None, doc=None): ...&#10;    def __get__(self, obj, objtype=None): ...&#10;    def __set__(self, obj, value): ...&#10;    def __delete__(self, obj): ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, fget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fdel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, doc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark